UNITREE GO2 ROBOT MODEL
=======================

The visualization example in packages/unitree-go2 can display the Unitree
Go2 URDF and Collada meshes packaged by go2_ros2_sdk
(https://github.com/abizovnuralem/go2_ros2_sdk).

Those files are NOT redistributed in this repository or in any built
distribution. They are downloaded on demand, at the user's request, into a
local cache directory. This is deliberate policy, not an implementation
detail: it keeps third-party artwork out of this repository and out of the
wheels. Do not vendor them.

MULTISET VPS
============

These packages are clients for the MultiSet VPS service. Users supply their own
credentials; none are included in this distribution.
